{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mahou Arms</i> is an anime-inspired character-action hack and slash that tells the story of a magical girl paramilitary group fighting back against an alien invasion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165870/extras/fd7ce03f01ae6b145c99ecb839dd707d.poster.avif?t=1769452732\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165870/extras/fd7ce03f01ae6b145c99ecb839dd707d.webm?t=1769452732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165870/extras/fd7ce03f01ae6b145c99ecb839dd707d.mp4?t=1769452732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The human race is on the brink of total subjugation by the alien force known as the \u2018Locks. GARDA, a global paramilitary organization has finally discovered the means to fight back: magical girls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a commander at GARDA. You must lead your small, ragtag group toward victory at all costs. Get to know your newly recruited \u201csoldiers\u201d and take direct control on the battlefield to reclaim Earth. Good luck, commander.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth Character Action Combat</strong> \u2013 Control a magical girl and fight with a variety of moves to take out your opponents!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Gripping Story</strong> \u2013 Follow the struggle of GARDA and get to know the magical girls you command, along with a number of other characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Playable Magical Girls</strong>  \u2013 Experience their unique movesets and playstyles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side Quests and Alternative Gameplay</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Accept and complete side quests and enjoy a variety of different minigames (cyberspace battles, drone racing, and rail shooting (COMING SOON))\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting Boss Battles</strong>  \u2013 Fight unique bosses with interesting backstories! One boss battle currently available with more to come.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RELEASE ROADMAP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are one major release from leaving early access (excluding minor releases). The next release (1.0) will be available in Q1 2026 and will contain chapter 7, 8, and 9 (the final chapter).</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Astronaut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1165870/6ad14a5b8d7fe1d7abca0a2625c58b2892cffd7b.jpg"},{"name":"Script Kiddie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1165870/6ad14a5b8d7fe1d7abca0a2625c58b2892cffd7b.jpg"},{"name":"Tourist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1165870/ab8d31084d43ede9d70ae5cca78604c5aba16aba.jpg"},{"name":"Scientist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1165870/ab8d31084d43ede9d70ae5cca78604c5aba16aba.jpg"},{"name":"Historian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1165870/ab8d31084d43ede9d70ae5cca78604c5aba16aba.jpg"},{"name":"Recovery Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1165870/ab8d31084d43ede9d70ae5cca78604c5aba16aba.jpg"},{"name":"Soldier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1165870/e32a8b0e03bc3206c338f2fdef83f95199aabc96.jpg"},{"name":"General","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1165870/5615a303e1778d40a3dc9fe889a6a0ee05a26d01.jpg"},{"name":"Magical Girl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstati